            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It was discussed in #490 and #864 with [the resolution](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/864#issuecomment-2100061440) that I think this is not a good long term idea. If there is a mapping, then user needs to be aware of that. If it is for mappings that user hasn't created explicitly, then [adjusting their description](https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-clue.html#miniclue.set_mapping_desc) or deleting them is what I'd suggest.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">It was discussed in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1910297827\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/490\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/490/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/490\">#490</a> and <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2284508833\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/864\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/864/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/864\">#864</a> with <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/864#issuecomment-2100061440\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/864/hovercard\">the resolution</a> that I think this is not a good long term idea. If there is a mapping, then user needs to be aware of that. If it is for mappings that user hasn't created explicitly, then <a href=\"https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-clue.html#miniclue.set_mapping_desc\" rel=\"nofollow\">adjusting their description</a> or deleting them is what I'd suggest.</p>",
            "bodyText": "It was discussed in #490 and #864 with the resolution that I think this is not a good long term idea. If there is a mapping, then user needs to be aware of that. If it is for mappings that user hasn't created explicitly, then adjusting their description or deleting them is what I'd suggest.",
